      "statement": "The water-loss intake workflow opens a distinct claim file, records source, affected locations, discovery date, reporter, policy and party information, acknowledges and communicates next steps, instructs reasonable mitigation within three days after discovery, and uses an approved reservation of rights within ten days after identifying potentially limiting facts when a final decision is not yet supportable.",
