      "id": "claim_b4011868bc2d4c66be7bf42ccd76eb57",
      "statement": "Notice timing is contract-specific rather than a universal 30-day rule: HO 04 90 (2026-01) does not state a notice period in the endorsement, DP 04 95 (2021-05) requires reporting within 30 days after loss, and HO-3 2024-03 requires prompt notice stating known facts, damaged property, and location.",
