    {
      "id": "claim_690d98b4714246f9bdb7ad7d3e0fd3fc",
      "statement": "The HO-3 2024-03 base form covers direct physical loss from accidental discharge or overflow of listed plumbing, heating, air-conditioning, sprinkler, or household-appliance systems, but excludes continuous or repeated seepage and does not cover loss to the system or appliance from which water escaped; its water-backup and sump exclusions remain unless an applicable endorsement changes them.",
      "evidence": [
