    {
      "id": "claim_ec1869c6ed7b49b080280b5396942ebf",
      "statement": "Payment handling requires authority, payee and interested-party checks, application of the form-specific limit and deductible, approved payment processing, separate expense and indemnity authority, reconciliation of prior payments, and prompt payment of supported undisputed amounts; denials or partial denials require a clear written explanation tied to the applicable policy language. Under HO-3 2024-03, covered loss is payable within 60 days after agreement, final judgment, or filing of an appraisal award, while appraisal determines amount of loss rather than coverage or policy interpretation.",
