      "statement": "Fungi, wet rot, dry rot, and bacteria require a separate causation and coverage analysis from the initiating water event: HO-3 2024-03 excludes the microbial conditions except as provided by an attached HO 04 81 endorsement, while HO 04 81 requires a covered cause to first cause direct physical loss and the fungi condition to result from that loss, subject to its exclusions and aggregate limit.",
