      "statement": "For Illinois water-backup claims, IDOI-2017-10 requires prompt acknowledgment, identification of the responsible handler, a reasonable investigation before denial or limitation, material information requests, evaluation of the actual policy and endorsements, written explanations tied to policy language and known facts, payment of undisputed covered portions unless barred, understandable valuation and deductible explanations, record retention, and reconsideration of material new information; the bulletin is a claims and disclosure control rather than a coverage grant.",
